WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.523
Hello! Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.524 --> 00:00:15.690
I'm a great white shark.

3
00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:20.695
I'm one of the biggest fish on earth!

4
00:00:20.696 --> 00:00:23.477
Where do you live?

5
00:00:23.478 --> 00:00:27.295
Great white sharks live in the ocean.

6
00:00:27.296 --> 00:00:31.540
We like to swim in cool water.

7
00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:34.709
Are you dangerous?

8
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:39.271
We can be very dangerous.

9
00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:43.382
But we don't usually attack people.

10
00:00:43.383 --> 00:00:48.878
Instead people often hunt us!

11
00:00:48.879 --> 00:00:51.459
What do you eat?

12
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:54.518
We eat lots of fish.

13
00:00:54.519 --> 00:01:12.677
We also eat sea lions, dolphins, and turtles.

14
00:01:12.678 --> 00:01:16.373
So you have to hunt for food?

15
00:01:16.374 --> 00:01:20.270
Yes, we're amazing hunters.

16
00:01:20.271 --> 00:01:27.388
We can smell our prey from far away.

17
00:01:27.389 --> 00:01:32.045
Your teeth look pretty sharp!

18
00:01:32.046 --> 00:01:36.058
Our teeth are very sharp!

19
00:01:36.059 --> 00:01:40.546
We have about three hundred of them.

20
00:01:40.547 --> 00:01:43.537
See . . .? Snap!

21
00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:46.300
Are you fast?

22
00:01:46.301 --> 00:01:50.542
Great white sharks are very fast!

23
00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:54.396
Our tails are long and powerful.

24
00:01:54.397 --> 00:02:04.732
They help us shoot through the water.

25
00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:08.405
Look! There's another shark.

26
00:02:08.406 --> 00:02:10.468
Good-bye!

27
00:02:10.469 --> 00:02:19.311
Good-bye, Great White Shark!

